                   it the same TypeError, with it (3, 9, 0).  A no-op with a
                   sip that parses earlier.  For Pat: sip 6.17.1.
                   Upstream: https://github.com/Python-SIP/sip/issues/118
                   (PyQt6 6.11.0 on Gentoo, closed 2026-10-07), fix commit
                   a50bfc7290c13b2bcf14c4b9ca6ebfa34a139919, in sip 6.17.1.
